/* MaterialDesignIcons (Material Community Icons) — the EXACT glyph set
   used by the React Native edition (react-native-vector-icons),
   rebuilt as Compose ImageVectors from the upstream SVG path data
   (24x24 viewport). Generated by scripts/gen_icons.py. */

